WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000 line:1 align:start position:16% size:68%
Before there was Hourglass Diamonds, before the twinkling lights, the champagne, and the sparkle of a finished jewel.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:09.800 line:1 align:start position:16% size:68%
There was the jungle.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:21.000 line:1
My grandfather, Donald Haack, wasn't the kind of man who waited for opportunity to knock.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:27.900 line:1
He went to find it, half a world away, and a place most people couldn't even point to on a map.

00:00:27.900 --> 00:00:30.480 line:1
British Guiana.

00:00:30.480 --> 00:00:39.360 line:1
He was a bush pilot, a diamond prospector, and whether he meant to be or not, a storyteller whose life played out like an adventure novel.

00:00:39.360 --> 00:00:49.200 line:1
He ventured deep into the Rupununi, a wild stretch of savannah and jungle, flying a small plane that doubled as his lifeline to civilization.

00:00:49.200 --> 00:00:54.960 line:1
Out there, diamonds were still pulled from riverbeds by hand. Supplies were scarce.

00:00:54.960 --> 00:01:05.940 line:1
Everything else you built yourself, including the mud huts he crafted alongside the local Amerindian tribes, sharing fires, meals, and a language of mutual respect.

00:01:05.940 --> 00:01:11.360 line:1
On his runs back to Georgetown to refuel and gather supplies, he'd fly past the mighty Kaieteur Falls,

00:01:11.360 --> 00:01:22.780 line:1
a single-drop waterfall taller than four Statues of Liberty stacked one on top of the other. He'd watch the sunlight turn the spray into gold,

00:01:22.780 --> 00:01:27.200 line:1
as if the land itself was hinting at the treasures hidden below.

00:01:27.200 --> 00:01:28.960 line:1
The bush wasn't forgiving.

00:01:28.960 --> 00:01:39.800 line:1
There were days when the heat was relentless, the rivers unpredictable, and the only sound was the hum of the plane engine, or the silence when it sputtered.

00:01:39.800 --> 00:01:44.680 line:1
But it was there, in those uncharted places, that he learned the truth.

00:01:44.680 --> 00:01:52.000 line:1
The value of a diamond isn't just in how it shines, but in the journey it takes to be found.

00:01:52.000 --> 00:01:59.080 line:1
That spirit of adventure didn't stop in the jungle. It found its way into me, Justin, his grandson.

00:01:59.080 --> 00:02:06.400 line:1
But I've carried it forward in a different landscape. My adventures aren't through rainforests or over waterfalls.

00:02:06.400 --> 00:02:14.080 line:1
They're across continents, sourcing rare gemstones from some of the most respected cutters and manufacturers in the world.

00:02:14.080 --> 00:02:21.000 line:1
We take great care in who we work with, and you'll see that reflected in every facet of what we offer.

00:02:21.000 --> 00:02:33.640 line:1
Now, more than ever, the diamond trade is built on trust. Today, that means strict adherence to ethics, ensuring every gem's origin is as clear as its sparkle.

00:02:33.640 --> 00:02:46.720 line:1
I've paired that heritage with a love for design and artistic vision honed over decades, and the resourcefulness to use the best technology in the market.

00:02:46.720 --> 00:02:55.360 line:1
From 3D modeling to precision manufacturing, my reach spans the globe, connecting with master craftspeople and ateliers from L.A. to New York and London to Hong Kong.

00:02:56.660 --> 00:03:06.720 line:1
At Hourglass Diamonds, we're more than jewelers and jewelry designers. We're trusted advisors, guiding clients through one of the most meaningful purchases of their lives.

00:03:07.060 --> 00:03:14.720 line:1
With the same care and respect my grandfather brought to the skies above the jungle.

00:03:14.720 --> 00:03:20.960 line:1
Life isn't about sitting around waiting or watching chances pass by. It's about going for it.

00:03:20.960 --> 00:03:32.000 line:1
That's what we do here. We find the rare, we craft the remarkable. And we do it for you so that your story, like ours, will last for generations.

00:03:32.000 --> 00:03:48.780 line:1
[Music]
